# Working notes — not part of the repo.
# Note `docs/*` rather than `docs/`: git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# DIRECTORY is excluded, so the directory itself must stay visible for the
# negation below to work.
docs/*

# ...except the reference ledger, which is published literature values only —
# every number transcribed from a source read in full, with PMID/DOI, cohort,
# and a note on what is and is not used by the model. It is the most reusable
# artefact here and the only one that had no history or backup. The validation
# log, backlog and ethics draft stay excluded.
!docs/reference_values.md
